  description: '2 monsters, including a "Vaalmonica" Link Monster

    Unaffected
    by card effects, except "Vaalmonica" cards, while you have 6 or more Resonance
    Counters on your field. Gains 1 additional attack during each Battle Phase, for
    each Level 4 "Vaalmonica" monster you control. Once per turn, when your opponent
    would Special Summon a monster(s), if you have 3+ Resonance Counters on your
    field (Quick Effect): You can negate the Special Summon, and if you do, destroy
    that monster(s), then remove 3 Resonance Counters from your field.'
